r eSIM?","This renames your eSIM in the app — it won’t be renamed in your device settings.","Delete from account?","If you delete the eSIM, you won’t be able to top up, renew, or track usage. \u003Cstrong>This doesn’t delete an installed eSIM from your device.\u003C\u002Fstrong>","eSIM name is required.","Maximum length of the name has been exceeded.","eSIM renamed","The eSIM’s name was updated in My eSIMs.","eSIM deleted","The eSIM was removed from My eSIMs.","Install in minutes with the Airalo app","Directly install eSIMs and track usage from our app — you can download the app from the App Store (iOS) or Google Play (Android).","Scan the QR code to \u003Cbr> download the app","Request remaining package","You can reach out to support to get your usage and remaining package details.","Please send \u003Cb>{usage_message}\u003C\u002Fb> to \u003Cb>{usage_number}\u003C\u002Fb> to get your usage and remaining package details.","Please dial \u003Cb>{usage_number}\u003C\u002Fb> to get your usage and remaining package details.","Phone number","Please send {message} to {phone} to learn your phone number.\t","Due to the provider, we may not be able to confirm if the eSIM is installed or track its usage.\t","Due to the provider’s policy, you must connect to a network by {date}.","View instructions","Buy new eSIM","How to use your eSIM","First select the OS and device you want to use.","Installation and connection FAQs","When should I install my eSIM?","Install your eSIM as soon as you’d like — just make sure you have a stable internet connection. You can also connect your eSIM in advance if you’re outside the coverage area, so that when you arrive, you can get connected immediately and start using your data package.","Where can I see that my eSIM is installed?","After you install, your eSIM should appear in your device settings with your other SIMs. If you don’t see your eSIM, it’s possible it was deleted or not installed properly — remember, do not delete the eSIM from your device if you intend on using it.","Why is my eSIM not working?","Your eSIM can only be used in its coverage area. If you haven’t arrived yet, you can connect when you do. If you’re in the coverage area, make sure you’ve completed all the steps in “Connect to a network” — try turning airplane mode on and off if you encounter issues.","Instructions {version}","Next, follow the steps to complete the installation process.","Install your eSIM","Installation takes a few minutes — make sure you read the validity policy before installing.","How to install","Connect to a network","Once your eSIM is installed, follow the steps to get connected and use your package.","How to connect","I have an iOS device","I have an Android device","iOS 17 and 18","iOS 16","iOS 15 and previous","I understand","Before installing","Previous step","Next step","Before you install...","Please read and follow our important tips to avoid installation issues.","The validity period starts when the eSIM connects to a mobile network in its coverage area. If you install the eSIM outside of the coverage area, you can connect to a network when you arrive.","Stay connected to the internet until the eSIM is installed.","Don’t exit or interrupt the installation process.","Don’t delete the eSIM from your device.","What are the benefits of eSIMs?","Get flexible, affordable and convenient mobile coverage.","You can buy and install an eSIM in minutes — all you need is internet connection. Without waiting in line, get coverage where you need it, top up to stay connected, and avoid high roaming charges.","How does Airalo use eSIMs?","Stay connected in 200+ locations with Airalo.","Airalo offers access to mobile networks around the world — your eSIM is your ticket to connection. Just choose where you need coverage and select the right eSIM package for you.","What do I need to use an eSIM?","You’ll need a device that supports eSIMs.","Many mobile phones and tablets support eSIMs — even some laptops and smartwatches do, too. To use an eSIM from Airalo, you’ll need to make sure your device isn’t carrier or network-locked.","It’s just like a regular SIM card, only digital.","Airalo uses eSIMs to help you stay connected and avoid huge global roaming bills while you’re abroad.","Device compatibility FAQs","How can I find out if my device supports eSIMs?","If your device has the ability to add an eSIM in its device settings, it supports eSIMs — the section where you can do this may be different, depending on your device. \nFor Apple devices, check Cellular or Mobile for the “Add eSIM” option.\nFor Samsung devices, check the SIM Manager for the “Add eSIM” option.\nFor Pixel devices, check SIMs for the “Download a new eSIM” option.","What does “carrier-locked” or “network-locked” mean?","Carrier-locked or network-locked devices are restricted to using networks and SIMs from one mobile provider — if your device is carrier or network-locked, you can’t use Airalo.","Can I use Airalo with a jailbroken or rooted device?","As a security measure, the Airalo app may not work on devices it recognizes as jailbroken or rooted — we apologize for any inconvenience.\nIf your device is rooted or jailbroken, you will need to use another device in order to use the Airalo app. You can still purchase an eSIM from Airalo to use on a device that is not jailbroken or rooted.","How to check if you can use Airalo","Every package Airalo offers includes an eSIM.","You’ll need to make sure your device supports eSIMs and has no carrier restrictions to use Airalo.","Make sure your device supports eSIMs","You can usually check by going to the SIMs section of your device’s settings — we also have a list of devices that support eSIMs.","Make sure your device is not carrier-locked","You can check your device’s settings to see if it is carrier or network-locked. Alternatively, contact your primary mobile provider to ask.","What devices support eSIMs?","View all devices","Chat on Whatsapp","By signing up for an Airalo account, I agree to the {terms}. Learn more about how we use and protect your data in our {policy}.","Your verification code was sent to {email} — enter the 4-digit code to complete the verification.","Sign in to your Airalo account by entering your email and password","Sign up for an Airalo account by entering your email and selecting a password","Traveling soon? Learn how to activate your eSIM, and stay connected in 200+ countries and regions with in-depth blog posts. Discover travel tips, eSIM guides, and more.","Airalo Blog | World's Largest eSIM Marketplace","{country} eSIM, from {price} {'|'} World’s first eSIM store · Airalo","Coverage across 130 countries. Data, calls, and texts. Instantly connect to a mobile network. Affordable eSIM plans. 100% digital installation. 24\u002F7 support. World's largest eSIM marketplace. Download your global eSIM now.","Global eSIMs for Travelers {'|'} Data, Calls, Texts {'|'} Airalo","Coverage across all popular countries in {region}. Instantly connect to a mobile network. Affordable eSIM plans. 100% digital installation. 24\u002F7 support. World's largest eSIM marketplace. Download your {region} eSIM now.","{region} eSIM {'|'} Travel Without Roaming Fees {'|'} Airalo","Discover how Airalo became the world's first and largest eSIM marketplace.","About Airalo {'|'} Connect in 200+ Countries and Regions","eKYC - Standard","eKYC - Temporary","Top-up option","Other info","The validity period starts as soon as the eSIM is installed on a device, even outside of its coverage area. If you install your eSIM outside of its coverage area, the validity period will begin before it can connect to a network.","You may notice an alternative IP address with this eSIM. This does not impact your ability to use data.","Once your documents are verified, you can purchase this eSIM until your submitted documents expire.","You can top up this eSIM when your data or validity run out — top-ups are available once the eSIM is installed.","You have \u003Cstrong>{count} hour\u003C\u002Fstrong> to purchase this eSIM once your documents are verified — verification is required before each purchase. | You have \u003Cstrong>{count} hours\u003C\u002Fstrong> to purchase this eSIM once your documents are verified — verification is required before each purchase.","Card *{cardLast4}","Airmoney balance","{amount}% Cashback","Valid until {date}","Your loyalty level","Reward history","Give {giveAmount}. Get {getAmount}.","Learn about referrals","Total spent","Earn \u003Cstrong>{amount}\u003C\u002Fstrong> to be {title}","Share your referral code","Get {getAmount} for every friend that signs up and completes a purchase. Your friends get {giveAmount} off their first purchase.","Your referral code","Show more","You don't have any rewards yet.","Earn Airmoney. Level up.","When you sign up, you get 5% cashback in Airmoney every time you pay for an eSIM or top-up.","Level up for higher rewards","Unlock higher rewards at the Silver, Gold, and Platinum levels — earn up to 10% cashback.","Earn cashback, automatically","Spend your Airmoney, anytime","Use your Airmoney balance to pay for eSIMs or top-ups, keeping you connected worldwide.","Share your code, earn Airmoney","Share your referral code and invite them to download the app.","Give your friends a discount","Friends get {amount} off their first purchase when they use your code.","Earn Airmoney for each referral","You get {amount} in Airmoney when friends make their first purchase.","Show history","You don’t have any Airmoney yet.","Voucher code","Redeem","You receive {cashbackRate}% of every purchase amount in Airmoney — you can use it toward purchases.\r\n\r\nYour Airmoney balance expires on {date} at 00:00 UTC. Each time you make a purchase, the expiration date will reset one year — this includes purchases with Airmoney. If your Airmoney balance expires, your membership status will not be affected.\r\n\r\nAirmoney is marked against USD ($) using a third-party service. When using a d