ou must verify your identity to purchase eKYC required eSIMs.","Your documents have expired. Please re-start your identity verification process by submitting your documents.","Your documents are being verified, please wait until the verification process is completed. You can purchase eKYC required eSIMs once your documents are verified.","Your document has been verified.","Your document is expired","Your documents were not approved.","Your documents are being verified.","You haven’t tried to purchase any eSIMs that require identity verification.","No verification history","You haven't tried to purchase any eSIMs that require this eKYC.","eKYC Details","Rejection reason","{readingTime} minute read","Navigate to page {page}","Navigates to previous hero section content.","Navigates to next hero section content.","Read post","View all posts","Directs to the selected article or post.","Directs to all posts","Refer friends. Earn Airmoney.","Get {get_amount} in Airmoney for each referral — they'll get a discount on their first purchase.","A group of people standing together, wearing various clothing and footwear styles, with some appearing to be in a playful or dancing pose. The scene has a cartoonish vibe.","Find out how","Refer friends section","Helpful links","The page you are looking for does not exist.","A woman gazes intently through a telescope, her surroundings captured in black and white.","Something went wrong","Not found","Details on how to refer a friend","Ownership","Displays Airalo values related to ownership when selected.","Displays Airalo values related to empathy when selected.","Authenticity","Displays Airalo values related to authenticity when selected","Empathy","Iteration","Displays Airalo values related to iteration when selected","Our values section","Our values section selector","As a truly global organization, our values reflect the diversity of our team and our commitment to keeping people around the world connected.","A cartoon-style image of a cellphone displaying the Airalo application.","We’re a remote, international team committed to keeping people connected, wherever they are. Sound interesting? Learn more about working at Airalo.","A woman sitting on a chair while using a laptop.","Learn how we work","Working at Airalo section","Make your meaning section","Make your meaning","We share a fundamental and common purpose at Airalo: alleviating the pain and increasing the pleasure of fellow human beings wanting to connect worldwide. With a constant reaffirmation of this shared purpose, we discover and pursue our individual aspirations to sustain our lives in the most meaningful, productive, examined, and dignified manner towards a direction of personal intellectual and emotional maturity.","A suitcase placed on the ground with an airplane visible in the background.","Stay lean section","Stay lean","We are engaged in the complex business of simplifying our product and organization design every day. To fight different forms of waste and forces of entropy and to build a quick yet measured, vast yet artful, distinct yet complete Airalo, we continuously inject the life of new knowledge and skills into our work.","A magnifying glass surrounded by various graphic icons, set against a white background.","Report to yourself and the world section","Every Airalo team member is first and foremost accountable to their inner supervisor and critic. We excel through self-monitoring and healthy embarrassment about who we were yesterday. We aspire to create our individual work in a way that can be presentable to anyone and at any time. At the same time, we acknowledge the importance of submitting ourselves to helpful mechanisms of checks & balances, review, feedback, and control.","Report to yourself and the world","A woman sitting in a chair, working on a laptop while holding a phone.","Act proactively section","Act proactively","We allocate our limited agency and energy to calmly and proactively pursue Airalo's own path. We focus on building the world around us based on our agenda rather than being distracted by, drowning in, or reacting against others' work. We avoid complacency and, at the same time, evolve through and find common ground with anything noble and meaningfully novel.","A planet surrounded by various checkpoints and a calendar representing future plans.","Motivate intrinsically, reap extrinsically section","Motivate intrinsically, reap extrinsically","To create a long-lasting and enduring impact, we act with the principle that extrinsic rewards are dependent on a belief in the inherent value of perfecting our service to Airalo users and team members. We see the approval and applause of others as one of the criteria for the acceptability of our work but not as the ulterior motive to instrumentalize our efforts.","Put humans and environment first section","A couple of girls wearing backpacks standing beside a dog.","Put humans & environment first","Building an ideal service for others requires keeping the human at the center of everything in an ideal way. In the projects we put forward for Airalo products and our togetherness, we work to bring progress to humanity in all forms of its well-being. We invest our time and energy in listening, studying and catering to the human mechanism at the nexus of its sustainable relationship with the environment.","A woman happily riding a bicycle, featuring prominent wheels and a colorful bicycle frame.","Remain supportive, always section","Remain supportive, always","In the face of setbacks, we offer constructive recommendations for diagnosing and treating issues and provide social and functional support to our team members throughout. To protect the Airalo users and team members from future setbacks and learn from failures, we strive to positively contribute to the necessary problem-solving processes.","A pencil resting on a sheet of paper that features various icons.","Employ each other’s strengths section","Employ each other’s strengths","We read the talents and aptitudes around us and learn to see that everybody’s weaknesses are coupled with counter-balancing strengths. We matchmake each other's strengths and weaknesses for perfecting delivery, converting potentiality to actuality and creating spaces to cultivate individual flourishing at Airalo.","Two smiling girls waving their hands.","Exercise the art of diplomacy section","Exercise the art of diplomacy","With a deepened insight into human nature, we properly and prudently cushion expectations, sensitivities, capabilities, and disturbances with empathy, kindness, reassurance and recognition in the methods and language we use in our dealings with others as Airalo.","A collection of colorful icons, including smiley faces and emoticons.","Be authentic, become original section","Be authentic, become original","We strive for the ability to take initiatives proactively in line with the needs of Airalo users and team members. We do our best to coexist with our chosen identities, express our best qualities and preserve authenticity in our work while being original and independent in thought and action. We are conscious of our ability and right to mould the external environment on our terms in a world that stands ready to be changed.","A pencil drawing of a triangle next to a ball on paper.","Keep it legit section","Keep it legit","We uphold legitimacy as one of the most vital values. We believe that the end does not justify the means, that what is supposedly “achieved” through illegitimate means is not a success, and that methods that are contrary to universal ethical and legal principles invalidate the purpose of coming together as Airalo to serve.","A smiling man, wearing casual clothing, holding a phone in one hand and giving a thumbs up with the other.","Know your “vulnerable” self section","Know your “vulnerable” self","At Airalo, we are aware of and open about our shortcomings and drawbacks without guilt, shame, or fear. We strive to avoid pretence, grandiosity and self-righteousness and see vulnerabilities within a broad and sympathetic understanding of our species’ inherent imperfections. We acknowledge and honour our ordinariness to create extraordinary results together.","A woman sitting in a lotus pose, with a serene expression on her face.","See and speak the truth(s) section","See and speak the truth(s)","We avoid all forms of falsehood and impression management and strive to eliminate with maximum effort the reasons that distance people from the truth(s) and truth-telling so that we can continue building and serving with order and excellence as Airalo. We see truthfulness and hence transparency and trustworthiness as the rarest, most sought-after, favoured, and valued ingredients for progress.","A megaphone in vibrant colors, showcasing its horn and handle with a simple, bold design.","Imagine big, celebrate small section","Imagine big, celebrate small","In the imagination phase before our plans and execution, we progressively include as many people as potentially possible around the world, embrace the diversity of needs and desires, hope and aim for the higher and the better. We believe that the value of Airalo team members’ individual and local efforts is proportional to their purview. In the process, we execute good enough small steps with pleasure and celebrate the little things that go well with gratitude.","A girl with long hair holding a smartphone in one hand while she stands next to a shiny trophy.","Think and build systems section","Think and build systems","We acknowledge that we maintain and advance systems that interweave our micro-decisions and macro-level phenomena in direct and indirect ways. As we build Airalo, we shuttle between the beginning and the end of processes and holistically consider the many interdependencies of our work rather than thinking and acting in isolation.","A collection of vibrant and colorful objects arranged together, showcasing a variety of shapes and designs.","Create and follow collective thinking section","Create and follow collective thinking","A colorful cartoon depicting a man and a woman traveling in a car","We strive to create collective consciousness; a state of emotional and intellectual solidarity within the Airalo team by discovering, communicating, and merging the plurality of our ideas and attributes. To that end, we encourage dissent; engage in creative, sensible, perceptive and continuous deliberation and adhere to the shared course of action initiated in these deliberations. In doing so, we become far stronger, wiser, more intelligent and more capable than our individual selves can ever be.","Infer and interfere with causality section","Infer and interfere with causality","We study and closely follow the cause-and-effect relationships and the natural or social scientific laws governing our craft at Airalo for perpetual innovation. This adherence to causal thinking requires each one of us to identify patterns, collect data, interpret correlations, examine precedents and respect the gradual nature of true change.","Colorful pie chart illustrating data distribution, alongside wifi and progress indicators.","Working at Airalo.","Explore a world of opportunities.","Ready for your next adventure? Join us on our mission to build the gateway to instant connectivity worldwide.","View all vacancies","Directs to all open job vacancies at Airalo.","A woman sitting at a desk with a cat beside her and a computer in front of her.","Our people","Our team is spread across 60+ countries and six continents. What glues us together is our commitment to changing the way you connect.","A plane flying over a circular depiction of the Earth.","Our people section","We value diversity, inclusion, and equity. Our organization spans multiple continents, with various backgrounds and unique experiences.","Two women are sitting together on a plane, looking happy.","Learn more about our values","Directs to Airalo Our values page","Our mission","Airalo’s mission is to build the gateway to instant connectivity worldwide. We’re here to liberate the world from roaming limits and help everyone connect from anywhere.","A cellphone placed next to a suitcase, with an airplane in the background.","Our mission section","Benefits of working with us","Benefits of working with us section","Our Recruitment Process","Our Recruitment Process section","See frequently asked questions","A global company","We have teammates all around the world who continue to make Airalo an amazing organization.","A screenshot of a cellphone displaying a Airalo app","A global company section","Join the Airalo team","We're hiring! Find your dream job with Airalo.","Join the Airalo team section","Departments section","Departments","View jobs","Directs to jobs for selected department.","Newsroom section","Directs to the selected article.","It looks like we don't have any news items for your country or region.","Get in touch","Working on a story? We'd love to hear from you!","A woman sitting at a table with a laptop and a phone, wearing casual clothing.","Get in touch section","Contact our Media Team","Opens options to contact Airalo's media team.","Enter a media outlet.","Enter a media outlet with at least {min} characters.","Enter a media website.","Please enter a URL in the following format: https:\u002F\u002Fwww.websitename.com\u002F","Country \u002F Region is required.","The Country\u002FRegion field must be at least {min} characters.","Contact Name is required.","Enter a valid phone number.","Media enquiries","Writing a story about Airalo? Our media team is here to help. Please fill out this contact form and we'll be in touch as soon as possible.","Media outlet","Media website","Country\u002FRegion","Contact Name","Phone number (Optional)","Details","Send","Your message was sent.","Opens option to remove out of stock notification for selected eSIM.","Opens option to receive out of stock notification for selected eSIM.",