om packages with unlimited data, calls, and texts.","Airalo {'|'} Local eSIMs","Airalo {'|'} Regional eSIMs","Get affordable, reliable regional coverage with one eSIM — find packages for Europe, North America, Asia, and more.","Airalo {'|'} Global eSIMs","Get affordable, reliable global coverage with one eSIM. Choose from eSIM packages with data, calls, and texts included.","Learn with Airalo","Airalo {'|'} All eSIMs","Explore all of our eSIMs, including local, regional, and global options — get affordable, reliable coverage with Airalo, wherever you're going.","People use Airalo for international mobile coverage.","You can buy, install, and manage eSIMs from our app.","Stay connected abroad","Avoid roaming charges","Airalo offers coverage for over 200 locations — you can select coverage for a single country, an entire region, or even the whole globe.","Please complete the verification to continue.","Directs to Airalo help center when selected.","Search store","Provides list of locations based on entered search term.","To use an Airalo eSIM, a device must meet the following conditions:\n\n• The device supports eSIMs.\n• The device is not carrier or network-locked.\n• The device is not jailbroken (iOS) or rooted (Android).\n\nYou can use our list to see if the device you want to use is eSIM-compatible. Note, some regional models may not support eSIMs.\n\nOur list is updated regularly, but not exhaustive — if you don't see your device, check with the manufacturer to confirm it supports eSIMs.","Every package Airalo offers includes an eSIM.\n\neSIM stands for “embedded SIM” — it's like a digital SIM card. Just like physical SIMs, eSIMs allow devices like mobile phones, tablets, and even some laptops to connect to mobile networks.\n\nBy using eSIMs, Airalo can easily connect you to networks in your package's location. When your package runs out or expires, you can top up that eSIM to stay connected.","Opens option to change email.","Opens option to change password.","Co