2Fusing-managing-esims\u002FZSEEHBT5HW6F\u002Fwhat-are-renewals-and-how-do-they-work\u002FPM7FMOUCP2U9","Order summary","Stay connected with renewals","Never run out of data — automatically renew your eSIM’s package when your data is running low.","Turn on renewals","Turn on to stay connected","Your package will only renew when your data is running low — it won’t renew if your package expires before enough data is used, or if you run out of calls and texts.","Make sure you enable notifications for low data alerts.","Pay when data’s below 10%","You need a saved payment method — we’ll notify you each time before you’re charged.","Airmoney can’t be used to pay for renewals.","Turn off when you’re done","When you don’t need any more data, just turn off renewals — you can always manage renewals from the eSIM’s details.","We’ll turn off renewals if your package expires before enough data is used.","Automatically renew your package when your eSIM has 10% data remaining — you can turn renewals on and off from the eSIM’s details.","With renewals, you can automatically renew your package when your eSIM has 10% data remaining — here’s how it works.","Pay with business account","Orders made with the business account will be shared with your organization’s admin.","Turn on to automatically renew your package when your eSIM has \u003Cb>10%\u003C\u002Fb> data remaining.","Your package will renew for \u003Cb>{price}\u003C\u002Fb> when your eSIM has \u003Cb>10%\u003C\u002Fb> data remaining.","Package info","Your payment method was updated — renewals are now on for your eSIM.","Your payment method was successfully updated.","Account verified","You can return to WhatsApp to continue your conversation.","Return to WhatsApp","You're logged in as {name}.","Not you? Please change to your account to continue in WhatsApp.","Change account","Corporate discount","Airmoney is Airalo’s in-app reward currency — it can be used to buy eSIMs and top-ups.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>You can apply Airmoney to y