er a replacement, automatically.","US residents can only make calls and send texts with global eSIMs while outside of the United States — data still works normally. If you’re not a US resident, please update your billing info.","Proceed with purchase","Add a reason for this order","Your organization requires adding a reason for this order.","{percentage}% discount, max. {amount}","Your applied code has a max discount of {amount}.","Earns {cashback}% cashback","You’ve unlocked our highest level!","Explore loyalty benefits","Loyalty benefits","You earn Airmoney from every purchase — learn how to level up, earn more, and stay connected for less.","{cashback}% cashback","How Airmoney works","What is Airmoney","Airmoney is Airalo’s reward currency — you can use it to buy eSIMs and top-ups. You earn Airmoney from each purchase total and from referring your friends.","Does Airmoney expire?","Your Airmoney balance has an expiration date, but it doesn’t have to expire. The expiration date resets by one year each time you make a purchase, including purchases made with Airmoney. If your Airmoney does expire, your membership level won’t be affected.","What if I change my currency?","Airmoney is based on USD ($) and automatically converts when you use another currency.","Chat on Airalo","{percentage}% discount","To {title}","Spend \u003Cb>{amount}\u003C\u002Fb> more to reach \u003Cb>{title}\u003C\u002Fb>","Select a reason for this order","Dear India customers","We are currently unable to sell eSIMs to users located in India. You can still install and top up an eSIM purchased outside India.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>If you are outside India, you can continue using our services as usual. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.","This order is no longer eligible for a refund.","Please contact support if you need help or have questions.","Wrong purchase","Plans changed","Installation issues","eSIM not working","Need some more help?","You can chat to support if you have questions about your refund.","Scroll left","Scroll right","Sitemap sections","Selects current package to proceed to checkout.","Directs to the dedicated page about eSIM Store.","Displays different content sections related to Airalo's products and features.","Homepage hero section","Innovation","Displays Airalo values related to innovation when selected.","Trust","Displays Airalo values related to trust when selected.","Growth","Displays Airalo values related to growth when selected.","Customer-first","Displays Airalo values related to customer-first when selected.","Where empathy shapes how we work, and how we treat each other.","Help one another grow","By leading with empathy, we create space for understanding, respect, and genuine connection. We listen before we speak, seek to understand before we decide, and treat every interaction as an opportunity to lift one another higher. When we care for people first (our team, our customers and our vendors - everyone), great work naturally follows.","Empathy doesn’t mean avoiding difficult conversations; it means having them with respect and the genuine intent to help one another grow. We work as a team, showing care in every interaction, and respecting people’s knowledge, boundaries, and time.","We step up, because what we do matters.","We take pride in what we create and responsibility for how we do it. Ownership means stepping up-celebrating our wins, learning from our misses, and always striving to do what’s right, not just what’s easy. We hold ourselves and each other accountable with honesty and respect, knowing that true ownership builds trust, integrity, and lasting impact.","We prioritise what matters most.","We don’t pass the buck, instead we work together to get projects across the finish line. When things go wrong, we don’t point fingers; we learn, adapt, and improve. We know we can’t do everything at once, so we prioritise what matters most.","Curiosity over comfort. Progress over perfection.","Innovation thrives where curiosity meets courage. We experiment, explore, and push boundaries-knowing that every bold idea, every prototype, and even every failure brings us closer to something extraordinary. We learn fast, adapt often, and build with purpose. By embracing uncertainty, we unlock our best thinking and create products that truly connect the world.","We try new things and take calculated risks.","We don’t sit around wondering “what if”, we try new things and take calculated risks. We don’t worry that our actions will lead to being reprimanded, but know that if we do fall, our team mates will be there to lift us back up.","Assume good intent. Ask to learn. Build together.","We share as much as we can.","We don’t hide things from one another, wherever possible, we share as much information as we can, so everyone is on the same page and can make informed decisions.","Growth is how we turn potential into performance.","We start every collaboration with a full tank of trust. We believe in each other’s intentions, expertise, and care for the work we do. Trust gives us the freedom to ask questions with curiosity, to challenge ideas respectfully, and to learn without fear. It’s how we build stronger teams, better products, and a culture where everyone can thrive.","Being open to learning.","We want to be the best we can be, and we do this by following our core values, being open to learning, and wanting ourselves, our team and Airalo to succeed.","Our customers inspire everything we do.","We use customer data to adapt quickly, and design with purpose - to meet our customers needs today and anticipate what they’ll need tomorrow. In a world that’s always evolving, we stay curious and agile, connecting people through technology that brings them closer together.","Everyone plays a part.","When our customers have a great experience, we have a great experience. Everyone plays a part in that; whether you work directly with Airalo customers or support the teams that do. By supporting one anot